# loader Worker local-dev secrets (loader/.dev.vars).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in. This file is gitignored; the example is tracked.
#
# LOADER_TOKEN protects the loader Worker /run endpoint (POST only).
# Deploy once with:  cd loader && npx wrangler secret put LOADER_TOKEN
#
# Pipeline ingest URLs (PIPELINE_*_URL) are unauthenticated WRITE endpoints —
# the 32-hex subdomain IS the credential. They must NEVER be committed. Deploy
# them as Wrangler secrets after rotating any leaked URLs in the Cloudflare
# dashboard (see SECURITY-AUDIT.md, CRITICAL):
#   npx wrangler secret put PIPELINE_RUNS_URL
#   npx wrangler secret put PIPELINE_CONTRACTS_URL
#   npx wrangler secret put PIPELINE_UNDERLYINGS_URL
#   npx wrangler secret put PIPELINE_ERRORS_URL        # leave empty to disable
#   npx wrangler secret put PIPELINE_AUTH_TOKEN        # if Pipeline-side auth is enabled
#
# For local runs against the deployed Worker, leave the URLs blank here and let
# the Worker forward them. For local container dev (WRITE_MODE=pipeline), set
# the rotated URLs and PIPELINE_AUTH_TOKEN below.

LOADER_TOKEN=
PIPELINE_RUNS_URL=
PIPELINE_CONTRACTS_URL=
PIPELINE_UNDERLYINGS_URL=
PIPELINE_ERRORS_URL=
PIPELINE_AUTH_TOKEN=
